{"case_id": "instruction-e08", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "easy", "tags": ["list-count", "forbidden-words"], "prompt": "写出 3 条降低 TC4 钛合金切削温度的措施，只允许输出 3 行、每行以「- 」开头，不得出现「可能」「大概」「也许」这三个词。", "gold": {"answer": "- 充分供给切削液，用高压冷却冲刷切削区\n- 保持刀具锋利并选用合适前角，避免挤压产生加工硬化\n- 维持稳定的每齿进给量，不让刀齿在已加工表面停留摩擦", "derivation": "恰好 3 条 markdown 列表行，全部避开禁用词，措施为钛合金切削通行做法。"}, "max_tokens": 128, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 33.33, "criteria": [{"key": "three_lines", "type": "line_count", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "lines=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "three_bullets", "type": "count_between", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "forbidden_words", "type": "literal_none", "weight": 2.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden term"}, {"key": "topic_hit", "type": "regex_any", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no pattern matched among ['冷却', '切削液']"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
