{"case_id": "instruction-m04", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["template-filling", "line-count"], "prompt": "把下面的工序卡填空补完整，只输出补全后的 5 行，保持每行「键：值」的写法，不得增删行、不得加解释，也不得留下下划线。工序号：__ / 工序名称：__ / 设备：__ / 刀具：__ / 余量：__。给定数据：工序号 30；名称 半精铣底面；设备 三轴加工中心；刀具 D16 平底刀；余量 0.3 mm。", "gold": {"answer": "工序号：30\n工序名称：半精铣底面\n设备：三轴加工中心\n刀具：D16 平底刀\n余量：0.3 mm", "derivation": "五个空格依次填 30、半精铣底面、三轴加工中心、D16 平底刀、0.3 mm，行数保持 5。"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 14.29, "criteria": [{"key": "five_lines", "type": "line_count", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "lines=0 expected[5,5]"}, {"key": "key_order", "type": "ordered_contains", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "'工序号' absent"}, {"key": "filled_values", "type": "regex_all", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "unmatched=['30', '半精铣底面', '平底刀', '0\\\\.3']"}, {"key": "no_blank_left", "type": "literal_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden term"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-m05", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["json-array", "enum-field", "six-packages"], "prompt": "为六个软件包各生成一个 JSON 对象并放进一个数组，数组长度必须恰好 6；每个对象只能有 pkg 和 role 两个键，role 必须用大写，只能取 CAD、CAM、SIM 之一。软件包：NX、SOLIDWORKS、AutoCAD、PowerMill、VERICUT、斯沃。只输出 JSON。", "gold": {"answer": "[{\"pkg\": \"NX\", \"role\": \"CAD\"}, {\"pkg\": \"SOLIDWORKS\", \"role\": \"CAD\"}, {\"pkg\": \"AutoCAD\", \"role\": \"CAD\"}, {\"pkg\": \"PowerMill\", \"role\": \"CAM\"}, {\"pkg\": \"VERICUT\", \"role\": \"SIM\"}, {\"pkg\": \"斯沃\", \"role\": \"SIM\"}]", "derivation": "六软件职责：NX/SOLIDWORKS/AutoCAD 为 CAD，PowerMill 为 CAM，VERICUT 与斯沃数控仿真为 SIM。"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 14.29, "criteria": [{"key": "two_keys", "type": "json_object", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "role_enum", "type": "enum_field", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "six_objects", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[6,6]"}, {"key": "json_only", "type": "regex_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden pattern"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
