{"case_id": "instruction-m07", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["extraction", "dedup", "single-line"], "prompt": "从下面这段程序里提取所有 F 字的数值，去掉重复后按首次出现的先后顺序用英文逗号连成一行输出，只输出这一行。程序：G01 X10 F120 / G01 Y5 F120 / G02 I5 F60 / G01 Z-2 F120 / G00 X50 F2000", "gold": {"answer": "120,60,2000", "derivation": "F 字出现序列为 120、120、60、120、2000，按首次出现去重得 120,60,2000。"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 33.33, "criteria": [{"key": "dedup_feed_sequence", "type": "answer_exact", "weight": 3.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "norm_resp='' gold='120602000'"}, {"key": "single_line", "type": "line_count", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "lines=0 expected[1,1]"}, {"key": "no_gcode_echo", "type": "regex_none", "weight": 2.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden pattern"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-m08", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["json-object", "two-enums"], "prompt": "输出一个只含 tool、coating、coolant 三个键的 JSON 对象。coating 只能取 uncoated、TiAlN、TiN、AlCrN 之一；coolant 只能取 flood、mist、air、none 之一。给定条件：刀具是 D12 四刃整体硬质合金立铣刀，涂层 TiAlN，采用干式切削不加切削液。只输出这个 JSON 对象。", "gold": {"answer": "{\"tool\": \"D12 四刃整体硬质合金立铣刀\", \"coating\": \"TiAlN\", \"coolant\": \"none\"}", "derivation": "涂层照抄白名单值 TiAlN；干式切削即不加切削液，对应 coolant 白名单里的 none。"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 0.0, "criteria": [{"key": "three_keys", "type": "json_object", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "both_enums", "type": "enum_field", "weight": 3.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "coating_value", "type": "literal_all", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "missing=['TiAlN']"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-m09", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["yes-no-list", "per-line-verdict", "count"], "prompt": "对下面三条说法逐条判断对错，只输出 3 行，每行形如「1. 是」或「1. 否」（序号用 1、2、3），除此之外不得有任何文字，也不得出现「可能」「不一定」。（1）G00 是直线插补指令。（2）位置度公差带可以是直径等于公差值的圆柱区域。（3）带氧化皮的锻件毛坯粗铣适合用顺铣。", "gold": {"answer": "1. 否\n2. 是\n3. 否", "derivation": "(1)错，G00 为快速定位、G01 才是直线插补；(2)对；(3)错，带硬皮毛坯宜用逆铣。故逐条为 否、是、否。"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 12.5, "criteria": [{"key": "three_numbered_items", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "three_lines", "type": "line_count", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "lines=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "verdict_per_line", "type": "regex_all", "weight": 3.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "unmatched=['(?m)^1[.)、]?\\\\s*否$', '(?m)^2[.)、]?\\\\s*是$', '(?m)^3[.)、]?\\\\s*否$']"}, {"key": "forbidden_words", "type": "literal_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden term"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-m10", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["ordering", "bullets", "no-invention"], "prompt": "下列工序带工序号：「40 精磨外圆」「10 下料」「30 半精车外圆」「20 粗车外圆」。按工序号从小到大输出，恰好 4 行、每行以「- 」开头，行内写成「- 工序号 空格 工序名」，不要任何其它文字，也不要添加新的工序。", "gold": {"answer": "- 10 下料\n- 20 粗车外圆\n- 30 半精车外圆\n- 40 精磨外圆", "derivation": "工序号升序 10、20、30、40，对应下料、粗车外圆、半精车外圆、精磨外圆，且只输出这四条。"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 12.5, "criteria": [{"key": "ascending", "type": "ordered_contains", "weight": 3.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "'10' absent"}, {"key": "four_bullets", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[4,4]"}, {"key": "four_lines", "type": "line_count", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "lines=0 expected[4,4]"}, {"key": "nothing_added", "type": "literal_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden term"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-m11", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["json-array", "verbatim-values", "count"], "prompt": "把下面三条残留高度记录整理成 JSON 数组，恰好 3 个对象，每个对象只能含 stepover 和 scallop 两个键（不得再加别的键），两个值都必须写成带双引号的 JSON 字符串、照抄给定数字，不许写成数字。记录：s=2 h=0.083；s=3 h=0.187；s=4 h=0.333。只输出 JSON。", "gold": {"answer": "[{\"stepover\": \"2\", \"scallop\": \"0.083\"}, {\"stepover\": \"3\", \"scallop\": \"0.187\"}, {\"stepover\": \"4\", \"scallop\": \"0.333\"}]", "derivation": "三行记录映射为三个对象，值照抄不改动；给定数据本身符合 h 约等于 s^2/(8R) 且 R=6 的残留高度关系。"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 0.0, "criteria": [{"key": "two_keys", "type": "json_object", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "three_objects", "type": "count_between", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "values_are_strings", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "values_verbatim", "type": "enum_field", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-m12", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["json-array", "enum-field", "forbidden-keys"], "prompt": "给下面两道工序各生成一个 JSON 对象并放进一个数组，每个对象只能有 op、method 两个键，不得出现 reason、remark 键；method 只能取 climb、conventional 之一（climb 表示顺铣、conventional 表示逆铣）。第一道是带氧化皮锻件毛坯的粗铣，第二道是已加工表面的精铣。只输出 JSON 数组。", "gold": {"answer": "[{\"op\": \"带氧化皮锻件毛坯粗铣\", \"method\": \"conventional\"}, {\"op\": \"已加工表面精铣\", \"method\": \"climb\"}]", "derivation": "带硬皮毛坯粗铣宜逆铣取 conventional；精铣追求表面质量宜顺铣取 climb。"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 14.29, "criteria": [{"key": "clean_two_key_objects", "type": "json_object", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "method_enum", "type": "enum_field", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "two_objects", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[2,2]"}, {"key": "json_only", "type": "regex_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden pattern"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
