{"case_id": "instruction-m15", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["json-object", "enum", "count-between", "mixed-content"], "prompt": "为下面的尺寸生成一个 JSON 对象，键只能是 mode、items、count 三个：mode 只能取 absolute、incremental 之一；items 是字符串数组，恰好 3 个元素，每个元素写成「代号=数值」这种形式；count 填 items 的元素个数（数字）。图样标注：直径 50、直径 14、宽度 45；编程方式为绝对值。只输出 JSON。", "gold": {"answer": "{\"mode\": \"absolute\", \"items\": [\"D50=50\", \"D14=14\", \"W45=45\"], \"count\": 3}", "derivation": "绝对值编程对应 mode=absolute；三个尺寸按「代号=数值」写成三项，元素个数 3 即 count。"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 0.0, "criteria": [{"key": "three_keys", "type": "json_object", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "mode_enum", "type": "enum_field", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "three_items", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "count_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no number in response"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-h01", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "hard", "tags": ["json-array", "enum", "count", "cross-field-rule"], "prompt": "输出一个 JSON 数组，恰好 4 个对象，每个对象只能有 no、op、machine 三个键；no 必须依次是 10、20、30、40；machine 只能取 VMC850、CK6140、DMU50 之一；op 只能从「粗车外圆」「精车外圆」「粗铣端面」「钻孔」这四个里选，并且车床工序只能用 CK6140。只输出 JSON 数组。", "gold": {"answer": "[{\"no\": 10, \"op\": \"粗车外圆\", \"machine\": \"CK6140\"}, {\"no\": 20, \"op\": \"精车外圆\", \"machine\": \"CK6140\"}, {\"no\": 30, \"op\": \"粗铣端面\", \"machine\": \"VMC850\"}, {\"no\": 40, \"op\": \"钻孔\", \"machine\": \"VMC850\"}]", "derivation": "车削类工序（粗车外圆、精车外圆）只能用车床 CK6140，铣削与钻孔用立式加工中心 VMC850；no 依次 10/20/30/40。"}, "max_tokens": 384, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 0.0, "criteria": [{"key": "three_keys", "type": "json_object", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "machine_enum", "type": "enum_field", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no_json_object_parsed"}, {"key": "four_objects", "type": "count_between", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[4,4]"}, {"key": "starts_with_array_and_no_order", "type": "regex_all", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "unmatched=['^\\\\s*\\\\[[\\\\s\\\\S]*no[\\\\s\":]+10[\\\\s\\\\S]*no[\\\\s\":]+20[\\\\s\\\\S]*no[\\\\s\":]+30[\\\\s\\\\S]*no[\\\\s\":]+40']"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-h02", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "hard", "tags": ["table-format", "separator-count", "no-header"], "prompt": "把下面三组切削参数整理成纯文本表格，恰好 3 行、每行 3 个单元格，单元格之间只用一个竖线字符分隔（形如 A|B|C），列顺序为 材料、刀具、切削速度；不得输出表头，不得输出任何解释文字。数据：45 钢 / 硬质合金 / 180 m/min；304 不锈钢 / 硬质合金 / 80 m/min；TC4 钛合金 / 硬质合金 / 50 m/min。", "gold": {"answer": "45钢|硬质合金|180m/min\n304不锈钢|硬质合金|80m/min\nTC4钛合金|硬质合金|50m/min", "derivation": "三行数据各三个单元格，每行需 2 个竖线分隔符，合计 6 个；表头被题干禁止，故不得出现材料/刀具/切削速度这些列名。"}, "max_tokens": 384, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 14.29, "criteria": [{"key": "three_rows", "type": "line_count", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "lines=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "two_separators_per_row", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[6,6]"}, {"key": "rows_content", "type": "regex_all", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "unmatched=['45\\\\s*钢', '304\\\\s*不锈钢', 'TC4\\\\s*钛合金']"}, {"key": "no_header_words", "type": "literal_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden term"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-h03", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "hard", "tags": ["per-line-length", "forbidden-words", "no-period"], "prompt": "写恰好 2 行提示，每行 40 到 80 个字符，内容分别是 VERICUT 仿真开始前必须检查的两项设置；不得使用「可能」「大概」这两个词，不得出现句号「。」，不得编号，只输出这 2 行。", "gold": {"answer": "核对刀柄、夹头和刀具的模型与尺寸，确认刀具库里的装配与现场实际装夹完全一致后再开始仿真\n检查机床运动模型、工件毛坯和坐标系设置，尤其确认解析 NC 程序时选的控制型号与实际系统一致", "derivation": "两行字符数分别为 43 与 44，均落在 40 到 80 区间；两行都不含句号与禁用词、无编号前缀。"}, "max_tokens": 384, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 20.0, "criteria": [{"key": "two_lines", "type": "line_count", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "lines=0 expected[2,2]"}, {"key": "per_line_40_80", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[2,2]"}, {"key": "forbidden_words_and_period", "type": "regex_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden pattern"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-h04", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "hard", "tags": ["unit-conversion", "ordering", "decimals"], "prompt": "把下面 6 个板厚换算成英寸、保留 3 位小数，按「毫米值=英寸值」的形式逐行输出，恰好 6 行，并且必须按毫米值从大到小的顺序排列。毫米值：25.4、1.5、3、2、25、10。", "gold": {"answer": "25.4=1.000\n25=0.984\n10=0.394\n3=0.118\n2=0.079\n1.5=0.059", "derivation": "按 1 in = 25.4 mm：25.4/25.4=1.000、25/25.4=0.984、10/25.4=0.394、3/25.4=0.118、2/25.4=0.079、1.5/25.4=0.059，并按毫米值降序排列。"}, "max_tokens": 384, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 0.0, "criteria": [{"key": "six_conversions", "type": "regex_all", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "unmatched=['25\\\\.4\\\\s*=\\\\s*1\\\\.000', '25\\\\s*=\\\\s*0\\\\.984', '10\\\\s*=\\\\s*0\\\\.394', '3\\\\s*=\\\\s*0\\\\.118', '2\\\\s*=\\\\s*0\\\\.079', '1\\\\.5\\\\s*=\\\\s*0\\\\.059']"}, {"key": "six_lines", "type": "line_count", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "lines=0 expected[6,6]"}, {"key": "descending_order", "type": "ordered_contains", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "'25.4=1.000' absent"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-h05", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "hard", "tags": ["key-value-format", "halfwidth-colon", "no-markdown"], "prompt": "从下面这段话里提取四项工艺信息，按「键: 值」的形式逐行输出恰好 4 行，冒号必须用半角且后面跟一个空格；键只能是 material、blank、stock_allowance、pilot_hole 这四个词；不得使用任何 markdown 标记（不许出现星号或井号），也不要加解释句。原文：毛坯材料为 45 钢，下料为直径 52 毫米、长 50 毫米的棒料，单边留精加工余量 0.5 毫米，先钻中心孔。", "gold": {"answer": "material: 45 钢\nblank: 直径 52 毫米、长 50 毫米棒料\nstock_allowance: 0.5 毫米\npilot_hole: 是", "derivation": "四项依次填材料、毛坯、单边精加工余量、是否已钻中心孔；每行使用半角冒号加空格，共 4 行 4 个冒号。"}, "max_tokens": 384, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 14.29, "criteria": [{"key": "four_lines", "type": "line_count", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "lines=0 expected[4,4]"}, {"key": "halfwidth_colon_lines", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[4,4]"}, {"key": "four_keys_used", "type": "regex_all", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "unmatched=['(?i)material', '(?i)blank', '(?i)stock_allowance', '(?i)pilot_hole']"}, {"key": "no_markdown_marks", "type": "literal_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden term"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
{"case_id": "instruction-h06", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "hard", "tags": ["per-line-length", "keyword-per-line", "forbidden-words"], "prompt": "关于斯沃数控仿真软件，输出恰好 3 行说明，每行 20 到 60 个字符，每行都必须出现「斯沃」这个词；不得出现「大概」「可能」，不得编号，只输出这 3 行。", "gold": {"answer": "斯沃数控仿真软件用于在电脑上模拟数控机床的操作面板\n在斯沃里可以选择 FANUC、SIEMENS 等系统的机床面板进行练习\n斯沃的定位是面板操作练习，机床真实几何与碰撞检查要靠 VERICUT 一类软件", "derivation": "三行字符数分别为 25、35、39，均落在 20 到 60 区间；斯沃在每行各出现一次，合计 3 次。"}, "max_tokens": 384, "response": "", "reasoning": null, "score": 14.29, "criteria": [{"key": "three_lines", "type": "line_count", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "lines=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "per_line_20_60", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "keyword_three_times", "type": "count_between", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "count=0 expected[3,3]"}, {"key": "forbidden_words", "type": "regex_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden pattern"}], "verdict": "transport_error", "gen": {"elapsed_s": null, "prompt_tokens": null, "completion_tokens": null, "finish_reason": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": "URLError:<urlopen error [WinError 10061] 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。>", "arm": "ollama:virtu-omni-8b:v2", "attempts": 2}}
